  "title": "tacacs: Warn about unencrypted payload option",
  "description": "To quote RFC 8907, \"This option is deprecated and MUST NOT be used in\nproduction... A request MUST be dropped if TAC_PLUS_UNENCRYPTED_FLAG\nis set to true... This flag SHOULD be clear in all deployments,...\nobfuscated mode can and SHOULD be used even during test.\"\n\nAdd an expert info warning if the bit is set.\n\nRelated to #19325",
